  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk | Amherst, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Discover Amherst  \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     Find It Fast   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t 2026 State of NH DMV Fees \r\n\t\t\t Absentee Ballot Request \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licensing \r\n\t\t\t Election Results \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t NH SECRETARY OF STATE ELECTIONS \r\n\t\t\t Register to Vote \r\n\t\t\t Supervisors of the Checklist \r\n\t\t\t  Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records Requests \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk\t\t \r\nSAMPLE BALLOT, General Election Nov 3, 2026 \r\nDuties of the Amherst Town Clerk \nThe Town Clerk and Deputy Town Clerk are municipal agents for the State. They can process State vehicle registrations, renew vehicle licenses, process new plates and transfers, and process boat registrations. \nThe Town Clerk can provide dog licenses. \nThe Town Clerk can provide marriage licenses by appointments and other vital records. \nAmherst citizens may register to vote and get absentee ballots at the Town Clerks office. See also  Supervisors of the Checklist  ( Voter ID Law ). \nAll Amherst residents are required to fill out a census form. Forms may be obtained in the Town Clerk's Office. \nRecords of the Town are available from the Town Clerk during regular business hours. These include Town history, minutes of meetings, checklists, and other public documents. Please make an appointment. \r\nContact Us \r\nTown Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t Amherst Town Hall \n\t\t\t\t\t\t 2 Main Street \n\t\t\t\t\t Amherst ,  NH   03031 \r\nAmherst Town Hall 2 Main Street Amherst NH 03031 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\nPhone:  (603) 673-6041 Ext. 203 \r\nFax: (603) 673-4138 \r\nHours of Operation \nMonday to Friday \n9:00 am to 3:00 pm \nTuesday Evenings \n4:30 pm to 6:00 pm \r\nDirectory \r\n\t\t\t\t\tNancy Demers\r\nTown Clerk  \r\nEmail the Town Clerk  \r\nPhone:  (603) 673-6041 Ext. 203 \r\n\t\t\t\t\tMark Vincent\r\nModerator  \r\nEmail the Town Moderator  \r\nCalendar \r\nTue, Oct. 27   \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Ballot Testing \r\nTue, Nov. 3   \r\n\t\t\t\t\t General Election \r\n\t\t         View All Events \r\n/Calendar.aspx \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Transfer Station \r\n\t\t\t Employment \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Permitting \r\n\t\t\t Voting & Registration \r\nTown of Amherst \r\n2 Main Street \r\nAmherst NH 03031 \r\nPhone:  603-673-6041 \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
